# ==============================================================================
# HUGGING FACE SPACE SECRETS CONFIGURATION (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# In Hugging Face Spaces, configure these as Space Secrets (Settings -> Secrets).
# To prevent automated scanners from flagging tokens, high-value API keys are
# split across two environment variables (e.g., A1 and A2).
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Tailscale Authentication Key (Split Secret)
# Generate an ephemeral, reusable auth key at https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys
# Example key: tskey-auth-k12345CNTRL-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A1="tskey-auth-k12345"
A2="CNTRL-abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Playit.gg Secret Token (Split Secret)
# Secret agent credential token obtained from playit.gg dashboard
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
P1="playit_secret_first_half_"
P2="playit_secret_second_half"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Chisel WebSocket Tunnel Credentials (Split Secret)
# Format: <username>:<password>
# Default fallback if unset is user:apple123
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C1="user:my_secure_"
C2="chisel_password"

# Optional fallback if not using split secrets for Chisel:
# CHISEL_AUTH="user:my_secure_chisel_password"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. SSH User Password
# Custom password for SSH login (user@hostname -p 2222 or via Minecraft tunnel).
# If unset, orchestrator.py will dynamically generate a random 16-char password.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PASS="SuperSecureSSHPassword123!"
